    "northStar": "Quiet Workbench",
    "overview": "The creator uses a warm canvas and forest controls around the actual generated artwork. Its character is calm and practical: a device sits beside a numbered frame while the person works. White work surfaces distinguish settings and current instructions without competing with the thread preview.\n\nThe current connection receives the largest numbers. The preview, text alternative and manual controls remain understandable together. This is the implemented local creator's visual system; the paused sales site and partner platform have no accepted visual implementation.",
